          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Implementation and communication controls",
          "items": [
            "Analyze direct, contributing, detection, and systemic causes",
            "Select actions that address evidence-supported causes",
            "Implement controlled changes and retain completion evidence",
            "Collect effectiveness data against pre-established criteria",
            "Approve closure or reopen with new ownership and due dates",
            "Document, procedure, software, tooling, or system changes are controlled",
